graph TD

    %% --- System Root ---
    IVISS[IVISS System]

    %% --- Applications ---
    IVISS --> FO[Front Office Android App]
    IVISS --> BO[Back Office Web or Client App]
    IVISS --> WS[IVISS Web Service]

    %% --- Front Office ---
    FO --> AGENT[Control Agent]
    AGENT --> PLATE[License Plate Input]
    PLATE --> MANUAL[Manual Entry]
    PLATE --> PHOTO[Photo Capture]
    PLATE --> CONT[Continuous Scan]
    PHOTO --> OCR[OCR AI Engine]
    CONT --> OCR

    %% --- Web Service Core ---
    WS --> AUTH[Authentication and RBAC]
    WS --> CTRL[Control Management]
    WS --> STATUS[Vehicle Status Engine]
    WS --> AUDIT[Audit and Logging]

    %% --- Databases ---
    WS --> EXTDB[External Vehicle Database PostgreSQL 9.4]
    WS --> MAINDB[IVISS Main Database PostgreSQL]

    %% --- Main DB Entities ---
    MAINDB --> VEHICLE[Vehicle]
    MAINDB --> REG[Registration - Gray Card]
    MAINDB --> OWNER[Owner]
    MAINDB --> CONTROL[Control]
    MAINDB --> USER[User]
    MAINDB --> ORG[Organization]
    MAINDB --> PHONE[Phone]
    MAINDB --> POS[Position]
    MAINDB --> LOG[Audit Log]

    %% --- Partner Systems ---
    WS --> PARTNERS[Partner Organization APIs]
    PARTNERS --> POLICE[Police Wanted Vehicles]
    PARTNERS --> INS[Insurance Systems]
    PARTNERS --> TECH[Technical Inspection]
    PARTNERS --> CUST[Customs Systems]

    %% --- Back Office Roles ---
    BO --> ADMIN[Administrator]
    BO --> SUP[Supervisor]
    BO --> MON[Monitoring Operator]

    %% --- Organization Hierarchy ---
    ORG --> SUBORG[Sub Organizations]
    SUBORG --> USERS[Agents and Supervisors]
